WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.069 --> 00:00:06.943
Here come the blobs!

2
00:00:06.944 --> 00:00:10.890
What do they see?

3
00:00:10.891 --> 00:00:16.729
They see an ice cream shop.

4
00:00:16.730 --> 00:00:31.164
The blobs go inside.

5
00:00:31.165 --> 00:00:43.953
They scoop some ice cream.

6
00:00:43.954 --> 00:01:01.293
They add syrup.

7
00:01:01.294 --> 00:01:12.058
They add bananas.

8
00:01:12.059 --> 00:01:26.091
They add whipped cream.

9
00:01:26.092 --> 00:01:39.577
They add sprinkles.

10
00:01:39.578 --> 00:01:46.680
They add nuts and cherries.

11
00:01:46.681 --> 00:01:51.359
The blobs are ready to eat.

12
00:01:51.360 --> 00:02:04.226
Blobs, look out! Oops.

13
00:02:04.227 --> 00:02:08.882
Silly blobs!

14
00:02:08.883 --> 00:02:13.936
Good-bye!

